# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# DTSC 520 site repo (github.com/greg-longo/520_full) -- THIS REPO IS PUBLIC.
#
# Source teaching material must never be pushed. It lives in 520/notebooks/,
# which is a sibling of this directory and therefore outside the repo, so it
# is already safe. The rules below are a second line of defence for the case
# where something gets copied or moved in here by accident.
#
# If you ever legitimately need to publish a notebook, export it to HTML under
# site/modules/ and add a narrow exception at the bottom of this file.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# OS and editor noise
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
Icon?
*.swp
*.swo
*~

# Dependencies -- never belongs in a repo
node_modules/

# --- teaching source material: do not publish ------------------------------
# Notebooks in any form
*.ipynb
.ipynb_checkpoints/

# Flattened notebook exports (tools/llm_export.py output)
*.llm.md
*.llm-*.md

# Master and student notebook variants, whatever the extension
*_MASTER.*
*_STUDENT.*

# Any directory named source/ or notebooks/ that lands inside the repo
source/
notebooks/

# Google Drive shortcut stubs (they leak internal doc IDs)
*.gdoc
*.gslides
*.gsheet

# Exercise solutions and answer keys, wherever they appear
*[Ss]olution*.ipynb
*[Aa]nswer?[Kk]ey*
Exercise?Solutions/

# Instructor-only planning documents
NOTEBOOK_REVAMP_PLAN.md
ROADMAP*.md
CAPSTONE_SPEC.md
*_PLAN.md
*_SPEC.md

# Local scratch
*.log
.env
.venv/
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]

# --- instructor-only: never publish -----------------------------------------
# capstone/_data held the answer key, the instructor passphrase, the cohort
# generator and the findings-verification script. None of it is loaded by any
# page. It now lives in ../capstone_source/, outside the repo.
capstone/_data/
**/INSTRUCTOR_GUIDE.md
**/verify_findings.py
**/cohort_generator.py
**/cohort_frozen.py

# --- narrow exceptions -----------------------------------------------------
# Published on purpose. Add here only after checking what the file contains.
!README.md
!auth/DEPLOYMENT.md
!capstone/assets/README.md

# --- student notebooks: published on purpose, July 30 2026 -------------------
# Decision: students can download the notebooks the module pages teach from.
# ONLY the *_STUDENT.ipynb variants, which strip_solutions.py produces by
# removing every cell tagged `solution` - 14 of them in Module 4, and its
# exercise cells read `### ENTER CODE HERE ###`. Verified empty of solution
# cells and of saved outputs before this exception was added.
#
# The masters stay excluded by `*_MASTER.*` above and must remain so: they carry
# a worked answer to every exercise.
#
# Git cannot re-include a file whose parent directory is excluded, so the
# directory has to be un-excluded first - `!notebooks/` alone does nothing.
# The final rule re-excludes anything in there that is not a student notebook
# or its data, so dropping a master into the folder by accident does not
# publish it.
!notebooks/
!notebooks/*_STUDENT.ipynb
!notebooks/data/
!notebooks/data/*.csv
!notebooks/README.md
notebooks/**/*_MASTER.*
notebooks/**/*EXECUTED*
notebooks/**/.ipynb_checkpoints/

# --- build litter from the Module 5 page build ------------------------------
# Module 5 teaches saving figures, so its section 12 and 13 cells really do
# write image files. build_module_page.py executes those cells with the module
# directory as the working directory, so the folder they write into appears
# under site/ on every build. It is generated output, not content.
figures/

# Page-build preview output (build_module_page.py without --live)
index-generated.html
